{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 0, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark a plan for Japan a journey grand\nA tapestry of wonders in this distant land.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo's Realm**\n\nFrom skies above to Narita's gate\nThou shalt arrive a traveler great.\nTo Shinjuku's heights thy spirit soar\nA modern marvel to explore.\nA hotel awaits a peaceful stay\nTo greet the dawn of a brand new day.\n\n**Day Two: Imperial Grandeur & Sacred Shrine**\n\nThe Imperial Palace a sight to see\nWhere emperors once held sovereignty.\nThen Meiji Shrine a tranquil place\nTo find some solace grace and space.\nHarajuku's streets a vibrant hue\nFashion's delight for me and you.\n\n**Day Three: Culture's Echoes in Asakusa**\n\nAsakusa's temple a golden gleam\nSenso-ji's beauty a waking dream.\nNakamise-dori a bustling lane\nWhere trinkets tempt and joys remain.\nSumida River a gentle flow\nA boat ride sweet a wondrous show.\n\n**Day Four: Hakone's Beauty Volcanic & Green**\n\nTo Hakone's hills we swiftly ride\nWhere Mount Fuji's majesty doth reside.\nA cruise on Lake Ashi serene and calm\nNature's embrace a soothing balm.\nVolcanic vents a misty sight\nA wondrous landscape bathed in light.\n\n**Day Five: Kyoto's Ancient Heart**\n\nBy bullet train to Kyoto we fly\nA city steeped in history nigh.\nGion's district geishas grace\nA fleeting glimpse a charming face.\nFushimi Inari's gates so red\nA thousand torii overhead.\n\n**Day Six: Golden Pavilion & Zen's Embrace**\n\nKinkaku-ji's gold a dazzling view\nA temple mirrored in morning dew.\nRyoan-ji's garden a mystic art\nZen's quiet wisdom for the heart.\nArashiyama's bamboo wood\nA whispering forest understood.\n\n**Day Seven: Nara's Deer & Todai-ji's Might**\n\nTo Nara we journey deer abound\nIn Nara Park a joyful sound.\nTodai-ji Temple a giant's grace\nBuddha's image in a sacred space.\nKasuga Taisha lanterns bright\nA beacon shining in the night.\n\n**Day Eight: Osaka's Delights & Culinary Feast**\n\nTo Osaka now our steps are turned\nWhere culinary delights are learned.\nDotonbori's lights a vibrant show\nStreet food wonders a tasty flow.\nOsaka Castle a proud display\nOf history's grandeur on this day.\n\n**Day Nine: Departure's Sorrow**\n\nAlas the journey nears its end\nA fond farewell to Japan my friend.\nWith memories made and sights to keep\nOf ancient lands and slumber deep.\nReturn to home with heart alight\nA tale to tell of day and night.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.011765611357986927}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.5393308401107788}, {"token": "▁plan", "logprob": -1.661582589149475}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.0019733496010303497}, {"token": "▁Japan", "logprob": -0.05252811312675476}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.011049510911107063}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.2723214626312256}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.07413104921579361}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.0007676515378989279}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.18621157109737396}, {"token": "▁tapestry", "logprob": -1.743149757385254}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.007624335587024689}, {"token": "▁wonders", "logprob": -0.6841986775398254}, {"token": "▁in", "logprob": -0.9775316119194031}, {"token": "▁this", "logprob": -0.09905167669057846}, {"token": "▁distant", "logprob": -2.0524325370788574}, {"token": "▁land", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.03889818489551544}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.0006985607906244695}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.010051113553345203}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.0065045543015003204}, {"token": "▁One", "logprob": -0.3162859380245209}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.31388604640960693}, {"token": "▁Arrival", "logprob": -0.0009505997295491397}, {"token": "▁in", "logprob": -0.00035553809721022844}, {"token": "▁Tokyo", "logprob": -0.039654091000556946}, {"token": "'", "logprob": -0.5180866122245789}, {"token": "s", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07},